            <p class="small text-muted mb-2">{{ "🇪🇪🇱🇻🇱🇹🇵🇱🇸🇰🇭🇺🇷🇴🇧🇬🇲🇰🇬🇷🇮🇹🇦🇹🇩🇪🇩🇰🇸🇪 Via Karpathia" | pageText(lang) }}</p>
